 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "The pro-'etale internal Hom for a site-perfect first variable",
 "statement": "Let $K',M'\\in D^b_{ctf}(X_{\\Et},A)$ have Tor amplitude $[a,b]$\nand $[c,d]$, and assume $K'$ is site-perfect. Then\n$R\\mathcal Hom_A(\\nu_X^*K',\\nu_X^*M')$ is bounded constructible\nwith Tor amplitude in $[c-b,d-a]$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-six-functors/sk-thm-sf-hom-ctf/cor-sf-hom-ctf-proetale-unconditional.md",
  "place": "node cor-sf-hom-ctf-proetale-unconditional, order 2200"
 },
